  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour the marinade over the chicken and mix well.</li><li>Cover and refrigerate at least 4 hours, or overnight.</li><li>The longer it rests, the softer it turns out.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-4",
   "images": {
