  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Preheat the oven to its highest — <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"240\" data-s=\"0\">240 °C</span></b> — for at least 15 minutes.</li><li>Thread the chicken onto the skewers and lay them on a prepared baking tray.</li></ul>",
