   "title": "Grill",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Turn the skewers and grill another 7–8 minutes. Check after 22–23 minutes in total so they don’t burn.</li><li>For the last 2 minutes, switch to broil for a little char. Slide the tikka off the skewers.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "240 °C oven → broil",
