    "result": null,
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 8,
   "part": "Creamy gravy",
   "part_id": "part-creamy-gravy",
   "time": "10+ min",
   "time_html": "<span>10+ min</span>",
   "title": "Soak the cashews",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"15\" data-n=\"2\">15</span>",
     "name_html": "Cashews (gravy)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the oil in a pan. Add the green cardamoms, onions, ginger and garlic.</li><li>Sauté until <b>transparent</b>, 4–5 minutes. <b>Don’t brown them</b> — browned onions turn the gravy dark.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "label_html": "<span>medium</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-9",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Sauté the aromatics — pale",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Sauté the onions, ginger, garlic and cardamom until transparent — don't brown them.",
      "src": "illustrations/chicken-malai-tikka/9-how1.webp?v=2ea97f57c1"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/chicken-malai-tikka/9.webp?v=eaa36ee193",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 9,
   "part": "Creamy gravy",
   "part_id": "part-creamy-gravy",
   "time": "4–5 min",
   "time_html": "<span>4–5 min</span>",
   "title": "Sauté the aromatics — pale",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\">1 tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Oil (for the onions)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-b=\"3\" data-n=\"3\">2–3</span>",
     "name_html": "Green cardamoms"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"150\">150 g</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-alt=\"1\">1½ cups</span>)</span>",
     "name_html": "Onions, sliced (not red or purple)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"2\" data-s=\"0\">2 cm</span> piece",
     "name_html": "Ginger, peeled and sliced"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-n=\"1\">2</span> large",
     "name_html": "Garlic cloves, sliced"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<p>Let the onion mixture cool, then grind it with the soaked cashews and the milk to a smooth purée (in two batches if your blender is small).</p>",
   "heat": null,
   "id": "step-10",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Grind the gravy base",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Cool, then grind with the soaked cashews and the milk to a smooth purée.",
      "src": "illustrations/chicken-malai-tikka/10-how1.webp?v=56532f710a"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/chicken-malai-tikka/10.webp?v=a7600deb92",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 10,
   "part": "Creamy gravy",
   "part_id": "part-creamy-gravy",
   "time": "~5 min + cooling",
   "time_html": "<span>~5 min + cooling</span>",
   "title": "Grind the gravy base",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"120\">120 ml</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"0.5\" data-alt=\"1\">½ cup</span>)</span>",
     "name_html": "Full-fat milk (or heavy cream)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat the ghee in a wide pan over <b>low</b> heat.</li><li>Add the green chillies and whichever whole spices you use — black cardamom, cinnamon, cloves, mace.</li><li>Careful, they can splutter.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "label_html": "<span>low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-11",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Temper the ghee",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Heat the ghee on low; add the green chillies and the whole spices.",
      "src": "illustrations/chicken-malai-tikka/11-how1.webp?v=f5fdfef7f7"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
