    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 11,
   "part": "Creamy gravy",
   "part_id": "part-creamy-gravy",
   "time": "~1 min",
   "time_html": "<span>~1 min</span>",
   "title": "Temper the ghee",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tbsp\" data-a=\"1\" data-b=\"1.25\">1–1¼ tbsp</span>",
     "name_html": "Ghee"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-b=\"2\" data-n=\"3\">1–2</span>",
     "name_html": "Green chillies, slit (optional for heat)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"1\" data-n=\"1\">1</span>",
     "name_html": "Black cardamom (optional)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"5\" data-s=\"0\">5 cm</span>",
     "name_html": "Cinnamon stick (optional)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-n=\"1\">2</span>",
     "name_html": "Cloves (optional)"
    },
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"count\" data-a=\"2\" data-n=\"1\">2</span> strands",
     "name_html": "Mace (optional)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Pour in the purée and the water. Bring to a gentle boil over medium heat.</li><li>Cover and cook until thick with specks of oil on top, about 12–13 minutes, stirring every 5 minutes.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "medium",
    "label_html": "<span>medium</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-12",
   "images": {
    "alt": "Simmer the gravy",
    "diagram": null,
    "how": [
     {
      "caption": "Pour in the purée and the water, then simmer covered until thick.",
      "src": "illustrations/chicken-malai-tikka/12-how1.webp?v=a9426d6eb0"
     }
    ],
    "illustration": null,
    "photo": null,
    "result": "illustrations/chicken-malai-tikka/12.webp?v=e42808fe55",
    "svg_fallback": null
   },
   "n": 12,
   "part": "Creamy gravy",
   "part_id": "part-creamy-gravy",
   "time": "12–13 min",
   "time_html": "<span>12–13 min</span>",
   "title": "Simmer the gravy",
   "uses_rows": [
    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"ml\" data-a=\"360\" data-b=\"480\">360–480 ml</span><span class=\"qalt\"> (<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"cup\" data-a=\"1.5\" data-b=\"2\" data-alt=\"1\">1½–2 cups</span>)</span>",
     "name_html": "Water"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Stir into the thick gravy:<ul class=\"ing two-col\"><li>garam masala (no chilli in it) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\" data-b=\"1\">½–1 tsp</span></span></li><li>nutmeg, grated <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.125\" data-b=\"0.25\">⅛–¼ tsp</span></span></li><li>salt (gravy) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\" data-b=\"0.75\">½–¾ tsp</span></span></li><li>kasuri methi (dried fenugreek leaves) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span></span></li><li>black pepper (gravy, optional) <span class=\"amt\"><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"vol\" data-u=\"tsp\" data-a=\"0.5\">½ tsp</span></span></li><li>turmeric (optional — for the yellow colour) <span class=\"amt\">a pinch</span></li></ul></li><li>Add the grilled tikka, cover and cook 2–3 minutes. Taste; add salt, pepper or garam masala if needed.</li><li>Stir in the cream if you like it richer.</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "low",
    "label_html": "<span>low</span>",
    "off": false
   },
